  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then, why I do not know, I went up to my study.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 4.48
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "It is all on fire.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 6.958,
      "seconds": 1.89
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The storm had passed. The whole country toward the common was on fire.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 11.083,
      "seconds": 4.62
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Across the red light, huge black shapes, grotesque and strange, went busily to and fro.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 17.917,
      "seconds": 7.34
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A glare on the railway. A wrecked train, its fore part burning.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 27.458,
      "seconds": 4.96
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Later, against the light of the station, black figures hurried across the line.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 34.625,
      "seconds": 5.12
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I turned my chair to the window, and sat, and stared at the blackened country.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 41.958,
      "seconds": 5.64
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Did a Martian sit within each, ruling it as a brain rules a body?",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 49.833,
      "seconds": 5.08
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Over the smoke, the small red point of Mars was sinking west.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 57.125,
      "seconds": 4.7
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then, near dawn, a soldier came clambering into my garden, over the palings.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 64.042,
      "seconds": 6.12
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "You there, in the garden! Up here!",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 72.375,
      "seconds": 3.31
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "artilleryman",
      "text": "Who is that? Who is there?",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 79.208,
      "seconds": 2.43
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Are you trying to hide?",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 85.167,
      "seconds": 2.61
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "artilleryman",
      "text": "God knows. That is it.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 90.0,
      "seconds": 2.15
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Come into the house.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 95.667,
      "seconds": 1.65
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I poured him out a stiff dose of whisky, and he drank it down.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 99.542,
      "seconds": 4.22
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He sat down, put his head on his arms, and wept like a little boy.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 106.0,
      "seconds": 4.94
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "artilleryman",
      "text": "They wiped us out. Simply wiped us out.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 113.167,
      "seconds": 3.34
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He was a driver in the artillery. Nothing living was left upon the common.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 118.708,
      "seconds": 4.89
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "We lit no lamp. Our hands would touch upon bread, or meat.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 125.833,
      "seconds": 4.89
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "At dawn we went up again. The valley was a valley of ashes.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 132.958,
      "seconds": 4.42
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "artilleryman",
      "text": "Just like parade, a minute before.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 140.292,
      "seconds": 2.51
    }
  ],
  "plan": "7c4da95ff8dbc808"
}